--- diagnostic store
empty merged: []
empty urisOf: []
merged sources ascending, producer order kept: [novus:first novus:second novusc:compile-error pureline:PL-NAME-001]
urisOf novusc includes the explicit empty list: [file:///a.nv file:///b.nv file:///c.nv]
urisOf novus: [file:///a.nv]
an empty list holds no diagnostic: []
replace overwrites one source: [novusc:compile-error pureline:PL-NAME-001]
the emptied source still counts as a holder: [file:///a.nv]
clear drops every source: [] []
other files stay: [file:///b.nv file:///c.nv]
clear of an unknown uri is harmless: [file:///b.nv file:///c.nv]
--- settings defaults and the full set of keys
defaults:
    pureline false plain=false
    lines 30/50/200/10
    names i,j,k
    check onSave '' 60 1500
    format 4 true 1
    own=true explicit=true indent='    ' max=200
settingsFromOptions of an empty map:
    pureline false plain=false
    lines 30/50/200/10
    names i,j,k
    check onSave '' 60 1500
    format 4 true 1
    own=true explicit=true indent='    ' max=200
every key:
    pureline true plain=true
    lines 20/40/150/8
    names i,n
    check onType '/opt/novusc' 120 1500
    format 2 false 2
    own=false explicit=false indent='  ' max=25
the same keys with dots:
    pureline true plain=false
    lines 30/50/200/10
    names i,j,k
    check off '' 60 1500
    format 4 true 1
    own=true explicit=true indent='    ' max=7
the section wrapped in novus:
    pureline true plain=false
    lines 30/50/200/10
    names i,j,k
    check onSave '' 60 1500
    format 4 true 1
    own=true explicit=true indent='    ' max=200
a list of settings is no map:
    pureline false plain=false
    lines 30/50/200/10
    names i,j,k
    check onSave '' 60 1500
    format 4 true 1
    own=true explicit=true indent='    ' max=200
--- text settings: a path may be as long as PATH_MAX, other texts are short
path of 300 bytes: 300
path of 4096 bytes: 4096
path of 4097 bytes is ignored: 0
executablePath takes the same limit: 1000
indent of 300 bytes is ignored: 4
--- merge writes into the existing object
returns current itself: true
nested objects are kept: true true true
seen through the old references: true off 8
a later merge keeps earlier keys: true true off
--- wrong types and out of range values are ignored
after the odd values:
    pureline false plain=false
    lines 30/50/200/10
    names i,j,k
    check onSave '' 60 1500
    format 4 true 1
    own=true explicit=true indent='    ' max=200
a float is cut: 12 3
only text names are kept: a,b
an empty list clears the names: 0
--- the novusc path has two spellings (V103)
novuscPath alone: '/a/novusc'
executablePath alone: '/b/novusc'
both: the first wins: '/a/novusc'
empty novuscPath falls back: '/b/novusc'
both empty clear it: ''
dotted spellings: '/c/novusc'
a merge without either key keeps it: /kept
a wrong type does not clear it: /kept
--- session
initialized false, shutdown false
placeholder codec utf-16
lists start empty: 0 0 0 0
settings are created once: true onSave
a closed document: true
no context without a document: true
an open document is found: true
the context carries it: true
another uri is still unknown: true true
after close: true true
--- locations
open file: file:///proj/open.nv 4
file on disk: file:///proj/main.nv 2
missing file: file:///proj/none.nv 1
no path: '' 1
std key: true true
--- targets
open document: true offset 18
another position: 8
unknown uri: true
no parameters: true
